# Interactive Shopping List 🛒

This is my shopping list project made using HTML, CSS and JavaScript.

## What it can do
- Add items with their names and prices.
- Mark items as purchased.
- Show the total cost of the items I have purchased.
- Edit an item if I want to change its name or price.
- Clear the whole list.
- Save my items even when I close and reopen the browser.

## Technologies used
- HTML
- CSS
- JavaScript

## How to use it
1. Download or clone the project.
2. Open the folder in VS Code.
3. Open `index.html` in your browser.
4. Start adding your shopping items and try the features.

## Project files
- `index.html` — the structure of the page.
- `style.css` — how the page looks.
- `script.js` — makes the shopping list work.

